Subject: [PATCH] power: supply: max77705: raise OTG VBUS boost current limit to 1500 mA

SPDX-License-Identifier: GPL-2.0-only

USB-C DisplayPort/HDMI hubs draw 600-1200 mA on VBUS during enumeration
and DP-to-HDMI bridge startup. Raise the MAX77705 OTG boost current limit
from 900 mA to 1500 mA (matching stock S22 capability) to prevent VBUS
brownouts and hub disconnects.
---
--- a/drivers/power/supply/max77705_charger.c
+++ b/drivers/power/supply/max77705_charger.c
@@ -621,8 +621,8 @@
 		goto err;
 
 	/* charge current 450mA(default) */
-	/* otg current limit 900mA */
-	err = regmap_field_write(chg->rfield[MAX77705_OTG_ILIM], MAX77705_OTG_ILIM_900);
+	/* otg current limit 1500mA */
+	err = regmap_field_write(chg->rfield[MAX77705_OTG_ILIM], MAX77705_OTG_ILIM_1500);
 	if (err)
 		goto err;
 
